1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:11,452
German conservative lawmaker Jens Spahn has resigned from a senior CDU role after controversy over becoming a parent through surrogacy in the United States.

2
00:00:11,402 --> 00:00:19,520
Deutsche Welle notes that surrogacy is not allowed in Germany, and Spahn's party opposes legalisation.

3
00:00:19,520 --> 00:00:27,373
The case has opened a wider public debate about family law, personal choice and political credibility.

